1
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:30,520
You can get a little bleeding after you take the tablet.

2
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:36,080
The next round of tablets you can take home or at the reception.

3
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,720
You and the healthcare staff agree on this at your first visit.

4
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,440
Insert the tablets into the vagina.

5
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:47,640
You need to lie still for at least 15 minutes after you have brought up the tablets.

6
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:54,960
You can feel bad and get a fever and chill, it is common and nothing is dangerous.

7
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:58,720
You start bleeding two to four hours after taking the tablets,

8
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,920
But sometimes it can take longer.

9
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:04,560
Take the last tablets after three hours.

10
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:07,800
You take the tablets whether you have started to bleed or not.

11
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,720
Insert the tablets into the vagina.

12
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:41,920
After the abortion it is common to bleed for one to two weeks

13
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:45,280
But how long and how much you bleed varies.

14
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:50,880
If you are early in pregnancy, you will bring a pregnancy test home.

15
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:54,760
The pregnancy test you do three to four weeks after the abortion.

16
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:58,160
You do the test to make sure you are not pregnant anymore.

17
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:04,200
It is important that you start with contraceptives immediately after the abortion, if you are going to have sex.
